  - assessment protocol
  - audit
  - AI governance
  - JSON Schema
abstract: >-
  A machine-readable protocol and JSON schemas for assessing whether an
  infrastructure system is corrigible: whether the people it affects can detect
  error, signal harm, and trigger correction without incurring material loss.
  It operationalises the five tests — EXIT, CODE, AUDIT, GOVERN, FORK — into an
  instrument an auditor can complete against a real deployment, rather than a
  framework that has to be reinterpreted for each assessment.
